# Cloudflare Pages routing rules.
#
# Serve /install straight from the file above (no rule needed).
# /docs and /handbook fan out to the two things that live off-site.

/docs           https://docs.labtris.com                                                                    302
/docs/*         https://docs.labtris.com/:splat                                                             302

# The handbook PDF lives on the current GitHub release. `latest/download`
# is GitHub's stable per-asset URL — it follows the current release
# without needing a per-version push here. Cutting a new release
# automatically updates this link.
/handbook       https://github.com/labtris/labtris/releases/latest/download/labtris-handbook.pdf            302
/handbook.pdf   https://github.com/labtris/labtris/releases/latest/download/labtris-handbook.pdf            302
